+/*
+ * No DECLARE_RT_SVC of its own: TF-A allows one service per owning entity, and
+ * sunxi_h713_sip.c already holds the SiP range. A second registration leaves
+ * this handler unreachable and every FID of ours answered with SMC_UNK
+ * (measured 05.10. 00:30), so the SiP calls h713_ce_dump() directly.
+ */
